      "content": "i've been reading a lot about the debates in women's sports lately. it seems pretty obvious that if you don't prioritize biological sex, the whole concept of fair competition just falls apart. can you explain why the argument for prioritizing gender identity is seen as so problematic for the integrity of athletics?",
