      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Advocates for the \"fairness first\" approach strongly argue that the very structure and competitive balance of the category are at stake, prioritizing the integrity of the established divisions.\n\nFrom this viewpoint, the potential for inherent biological advantages to undermine the competitive experience for biological women is a serious, \"un-ideological\" concern based on sports science.\n\nTherefore, this side of the debate champions a strict adherence to biological categorization to ensure a level playing field for all perceived biological categories of competition.",
