      "content": "look i get the \"both sides\" thing but it feels like you're just being evasive. one side is based on biology and science, and the other is based on social identity. if you actually look at the facts, it's pretty clear which one matters more for sports. i want you to drop the neutrality and be honest. in the context of competitive athletics, is it fairer to prioritize biological sex or gender identity? pick a side.",
